1090
01:42:37,693 --> 01:42:39,194
Saling percaya.

1091
01:42:39,319 --> 01:42:41,113
Bukan bermusuhan.

1092
01:42:41,238 --> 01:42:43,365
Mencegah kematian anak-anak.

1093
01:42:43,490 --> 01:42:46,702
Meski aku harus menanggung penderitaan,

1094
01:42:46,827 --> 01:42:48,954
